# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 2/5, item 28
# Base: apply after 0026-0027.
#
# Implements an exact dense Qwen speculative block forward for 1..4 candidate
# tokens. All heavy Q4_K matrices use LinearWBatch4, while attention remains
# causally exact: candidate b can see committed KV + candidates [0..b].
#
# This is target verification, not a draft approximation.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0028_exact_causal_speculative_block.patch

